@popular_front_coalition
title: 新たな「人民戦線」連立か？
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span>[? if (liberal_parliament == 0 and bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 0) and not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if sapd_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>?] ([+ popular_front_coalition +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ z_party_name +]</span>[? if liberal_parliament = 0 and not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if sapd_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">SAPD</span>?]（[+ popular_front_coalition +]%）――[? if ((kpd_relation < 65 and kpd_leader == "Thälmann") or (kpd_relation < 45 and kpd_leader == "Conciliators")) or ((z_leader == "Joos" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_relation < 35) or (z_leader == "Kaiser" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_relation < 30)): <span style="color: #700000;">KPD</span>との関係が十分でない。?][? if (z_relation < 45 and z_leader == "Joos") or (z_relation < 40 and z_leader == "Kaiser") or (z_relation < 65 and z_ideology == "Right" and kpd_leader != "Conciliators") or (z_relation < 55 and z_ideology == "Right" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators") or ((z_leader == "Joos" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and z_relation < 35) or (z_leader == "Kaiser" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and z_relation < 30)): [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]との関係が十分でない。?][? if ((ddp_relation < 50 and ddp_ideology != "Left") or (ddp_relation < 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and liberal_parliament == 0 and bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 0 and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>との関係が十分でない。?][? if communist_coalition < 3 : <span style="color: #700000;">共産主義者</span>は一切の妥協を拒んでいる。?] [? if rubicon:――ヒンデンブルクが認めるはずがない。?] [? if president_ideology = "Right":――大統領[+ president +]は<span style="color: #9B0000;">社会主義</span>政権に断固反対している。?]
view-if: popular_front_coalition >= 50 and not cvp_formed and not rubicon
choose-if: (((kpd_relation >= 65 and kpd_leader == "Thälmann") or (kpd_relation >= 45 and kpd_leader == "Conciliators")) and ((z_relation >= 45 and z_leader == "Joos") or (z_relation >= 40 and z_leader == "Kaiser") or (z_relation >= 65 and z_ideology == "Right" and kpd_leader != "Conciliators") or (z_relation >= 55 and z_ideology == "Right" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators")) and ((liberal_parliament = 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp or lvp_formed) or ((ddp_relation >= 50 and ddp_ideology != "Left") or (ddp_relation >= 40 and ddp_ideology == "Left"))) and communist_coalition >= 3) or (z_leader == "Joos" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and z_relation >= 35 and kpd_relation >= 35) or (z_leader == "Kaiser" and kpd_leader == "Conciliators" and z_relation >= 30 and kpd_relation >= 30) and president_ideology != "Right"

[? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]と<span style="color: #700000;">**共産党**</span>の双方を含む連立を本当に形成できるのか。荒唐無稽に思えるが、双方と良好な関係にある以上、不可能ではない。

この連立が成立すれば、<span style="color: #7A3C00;">極</span><span style="color: #3E88B3;">右</span>がクーデターを試みるかもしれない。

