@emergency_no_confidence
title: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">ナチ党</span>が直ちに我々への不信任決議を提出する……。
view-if: far_right_coalition < 45
on-arrival: {!
Q.z_no_confidence = (Q.z_relation < 45) ? 1 : 0;
Q.kpd_no_confidence = (Q.kpd_relation < 45) ? 1 : 0;
Q.other_no_confidence = ((Q.z_relation + Q.dvp_relation) / 2 < 45) ? 1 : 0;
Q.dvp_no_confidence = (Q.dvp_relation < 45) ? 1 : 0;
Q.ddp_no_confidence = (Q.ddp_relation < 35) ? 1 : 0;
Q.lvp_no_confidence = (Q.lvp_relation < 40) ? 1 : 0;

Q.sa_strength += 200;
Q.sh_strength += 200;

Q.no_confidence_votes = Q.nsdap_r + Q.dnvp_r + Q.dnf_r + Q.kvp_r;
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.z_no_confidence ? Q.z_r : 0);
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.dvp_no_confidence ? Q.dvp_r : 0);
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.ddp_no_confidence ? Q.ddp_r : 0);
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.lvp_no_confidence ? Q.lvp_r : 0);
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.kpd_no_confidence ? Q.kpd_r : 0);
Q.no_confidence_votes += (Q.other_no_confidence ? Q.other_r : 0);

Q.no_confidence_succeeds = (Q.no_confidence_votes > 50) ? 1 : 0;
Q.no_confidence_votes = parseFloat(Q.no_confidence_votes.toFixed(1));
!}

当然、<span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>[? if dnf_formed:、<span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>?][? if kvp_formed:、<span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>?]、<span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span>は反対票を投じる。他党は良心に従って投票する。[? if z_no_confidence: [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]は反対票を投じる。?] [? if lvp_no_confidence and lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>は反対票を投じる。?] [? if kpd_no_confidence: <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>は反対票を投じる。?] [? if other_no_confidence: 諸小党も反対票を投じる。?]

合計で国会の[+ no_confidence_votes +]%が我々に反対している。[? if no_confidence_succeeds : 不信任決議で敗北した。?]

- @no_confidence_elections_new: 再選挙を実施する。可能な限り延期を試みる。
- @no_confidence_win: 今のところは勝利した。


@no_confidence_elections_new
on-arrival: {!
Q.in_emergency_government = 1;
Q.no_majority_elections += 1;
Q.next_election_month = Q.month + 6;
Q.next_election_time = Q.time + 6;
if (Q.next_election_month > 12) {
    Q.next_election_month -= 12;
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year + 1;
} else {
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year;
}
Q.pro_republic -= 5;
Q.workers_spd -= 3;
Q.new_middle_spd -= 3;
Q.old_middle_spd -= 3;
Q.rural_spd -= 3;
Q.catholics_spd -= 3;
Q.workers_nsdap += 5;
Q.old_middle_nsdap += 3;
Q.new_middle_nsdap += 3;
Q.rural_nsdap += 3;
Q.unemployed_nsdap += 5;
// Thresholds are kind of arbitrary - adjusted because of negative economic effects on pro_republic
if (Q.pro_republic < 45 && Q.pro_republic >= 36) {
    Q.workers_spd -= 6;
}
if (Q.pro_republic < 36) {
    // TODO: if you pursue a consistently revolutionary course, you might avoid this? But you might also cause a coalition between Hitler and the Center.
    Q.workers_spd *= 0.85;
    Q.new_middle_spd -= 5;
    Q.old_middle_spd -= 5;
    Q.rural_spd -= 5;
    Q.catholics_spd -= 3;
    Q.workers_nsdap += 5;
    Q.old_middle_nsdap += 5;
    Q.new_middle_nsdap += 5;
    Q.rural_nsdap += 5;
    Q.unemployed_nsdap += 5;   
}
!}
view-if: no_confidence_votes > 50

次回選挙は[+ next_election_year +]年[+ next_election_month : month +]に設定された。


@no_confidence_win
view-if: no_confidence_votes <= 50
