@weimar_coalition_liberal_parliament
title: <span style="color: #000000;">ヴァ</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">イマ</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ル</span>連立を形成できる。
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?][? if sapd_formed and kpd_relation >= 30 and sapd_weimar :&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>の閣外協力?]（[+ weimar_coalition +]%）
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ z_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #FFCC00;">LVP</span>?][? if sapd_formed and kpd_relation >= 30 and sapd_weimar :&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">SAPD</span>の閣外協力?]（[+ weimar_coalition +]%）[? if not ((z_relation >= 30 and z_ideology == "Right" and year < 1930) or (z_relation >= 40 and z_ideology == "Right" and year >= 1930) or (z_relation >= 25 and z_leader == "Joos") or (z_relation >= 20 and z_leader == "Kaiser")): ・[? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">CVP</span>?]との関係が十分でない。?] [? if not ((ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 25 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed: ・<span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>との関係が十分でない。?] [? if not ((lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 35 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 30 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed: ・<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>との関係が十分でない。?] [? if rubicon: ・ヒンデンブルク大統領は<span style="color: #c00000;">社会主義者</span>政権への復帰を認めない。?][? if president_ideology == "Right": ・大統領[+ president +]は<span style="color: #c00000;">社会主義者</span>政権に断固反対している。?]
choose-if: ((z_relation >= 30 and z_ideology == "Right" and year < 1930) or (z_relation >= 40 and z_ideology == "Right" and year >= 1930) or (z_relation >= 25 and z_leader == "Joos") or (z_relation >= 20 and z_leader == "Kaiser")) and ((((ddp_relation >= 30 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation >= 25 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation >= 20 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation >= 40 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation >= 35 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation >= 30 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed)) and not rubicon and president_ideology != "Right"
on-arrival: weimar_coalition_failed = 1
view-if: (weimar_coalition >= 50 or (weimar_coalition >= 49.5 and other_r >= 8 and (year < 1930 or year > 1932))) and (liberal_parliament == 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1) and not lvp_formed and not cvp_formed

<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>、[? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]、[? if ddp_name == "DDP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**民主党**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**国家党**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**自由人民党**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed:（<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>）?][? if lvp_formed:（<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>）?]による「<span style="color: #000000;">ヴァ</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">イマ</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ル</span>連立」政権を樹立する票がある。しかし[? if liberal_parliament: 自由主義諸党?][? if bourgeois_parliament_ddp: ブルジョワ諸党?]は議員団を組んでおり、<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>だけを連立に加えることができない。

資源を使って<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>をこの枠組みから離脱させるか、別の政権構想を探すことができる。

